+  // 215 us with nothing open, and 43418 us with eight sockets.
+  //
+  // So the mask now follows what this socket actually wants, and is re-sent
+  // whenever that changes. That is the same edge-triggered behaviour, built
+  // where the intent already lives instead of in one backend.
